# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TRU PEPTIDE frontend — environment configuration
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This is a presentation-only frontend. It runs in one of two modes, selected
# entirely by whether NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL is set:
#
#   • UNSET (default) → "reference mode"
#       The app is fully interactive with NO backend. Catalog reads,
#       pricing computation, cart, account, orders, favorites, and admin
#       mutations all run in-browser against bundled reference data
#       (persisted to localStorage). Ideal for previews and standalone builds.
#
#   • SET → "http mode"
#       All data/client boundaries (lib/data/http/*, lib/client/*) issue
#       fetch() calls to your backend at this base URL instead. Implement the
#       REST contract documented in:
#         - lib/data/http/*            (catalog + pricing reads)
#         - lib/client/account.ts      (session, orders, user collections)
#         - lib/client/pricing-admin.ts (admin pricing)
#         - lib/client/catalog-admin.ts (admin catalog)
#
# Example: NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=
